WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 f4b6546cdc3ad8dde1f9b6b1f3ff5008

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.660
Karibu tena. Sasa unajua jinsi ya

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.640
kuunda vitendakazi vyenye ingizo na visivyo na ingizo. Kuna jambo moja

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.480
la mwisho la kujifunza, na baada ya hapo utakuwa

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.780
mtaalamu wa kutengeneza vitendakazi, na jambo hilo ni

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.160
jinsi ya kuipa vitendakazi vyako mteremko wa matokeo.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.020
Tayari umetumia vitendakazi vingi vinavyorejesha

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.400
vitu. isAlienAbove hukurejeshea kweli au sikweli.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.940
Math.randomInt(1, 10) hukurejeshea namba nasibu.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.780
Jiki anapotumia vitendakazi hivyo, kuna kitu kinatokea

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.980
nje kupitia mteremko wa matokeo, ambacho anaweza

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.180
kukitumia baadaye. Kwa hiyo ili kufanya hivi,

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.890
tunahitaji keyword nyingine mpya, nayo ni

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.900
keyword ya return. Keyword ya return inamwambia Mini

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.320
Jiki kusukuma kitu nje kupitia mteremko

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.230
wa matokeo. Hebu tutengeneze kitendakazi, na

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.760
tukiite meaningOfLife (maana ya maisha), na kazi ya

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.089
kitendakazi hiki ni kurejesha namba

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.200
42 kila wakati. Hakina ingizo lolote. Kwa hiyo

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:58.839
unaweza kuandika function meaningOfLife, mabano ya msokoto, na

00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:02.339
kisha mstari mmoja ndani ya kitendakazi hicho:

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:06.539
return 42. Mstari huo unamwambia Mini Jiki asukume

00:01:06.579 --> 00:01:09.539
namba 42 kupitia mteremko wa matokeo kisha

00:01:09.679 --> 00:01:13.559
asimame. Ni muhimu kusikia hilo. Keyword ya return

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:17.079
inamwambia Mini Jiki afanye mambo mawili. Kwanza,

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.639
aweke kitu kwenye mteremko wa matokeo, na

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.779
pili, asimame. Mara tu

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:26.579
unapotumia keyword ya return, kitendakazi kinaisha. Mini Jiki

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:30.059
hatafanya kitu kingine chochote. Sasa, kama hujui

00:01:30.139 --> 00:01:32.540
marejeleo ya "maana ya maisha", yanatoka

00:01:32.579 --> 00:01:34.880
kwenye kitabu na filamu maarufu viitwavyo

00:01:34.899 --> 00:01:37.840
The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy. Nakushauri

00:01:37.879 --> 00:01:39.819
ukisome. Huna haja ya kuhangaika sana

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:43.799
kuhusu maana ya 42 kwa sasa. Hebu

00:01:43.879 --> 00:01:47.819
tuangalie mfano mgumu kidogo zaidi, ambapo

00:01:47.879 --> 00:01:50.439
tuna kitendakazi chenye ingizo

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.479
na mteremko wa matokeo. Tutatumia wazo

00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:54.520
lile lile la kitendakazi kiitwacho

00:01:54.599 --> 00:01:57.239
meaningOfLife, na hiki kina tundu la ingizo

00:01:57.299 --> 00:02:00.439
liitwalo age. Kama mtu ana miaka 18 au zaidi,

00:02:00.559 --> 00:02:01.839
tutamwambia kwamba maana ya

00:02:01.939 --> 00:02:05.639
maisha ni 42. Vinginevyo, tutarejesha tu

00:02:05.699 --> 00:02:09.019
string "Sorry, too young." Tunakiunda kitendakazi

00:02:09.059 --> 00:02:12.679
kwa njia inayofanana sana. function meaningOfLife, kisha

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:15.379
tundu la ingizo age ndani ya mabano, kisha

00:02:15.419 --> 00:02:18.339
mabano ya msokoto. Lakini sasa tunahitaji

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.459
kauli ya masharti ndani yake ili tuweze kusema,

00:02:20.619 --> 00:02:23.019
"Kama age ni kubwa kuliko au sawa na

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.499
18, tunarejesha 42. Vinginevyo, tunarejesha 'Sorry,

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.719
too young.'" Sasa, tukitumia kitendakazi hicho

00:02:30.779 --> 00:02:33.759
kwa kuandika meaningOfLife(15), tutarejeshewa

00:02:33.799 --> 00:02:37.119
string "Sorry, too young." Na tukiandika

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.060
meaningOfLife(30), tutarejeshewa

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.800
namba 42. Kwa hiyo hivi ndivyo

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.800
kupanga programu kunavyofanya kazi kwa msingi wake. Tunatengeneza

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.360
vitalu vidogo vingi vya ujenzi kama hivi kisha

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:52.960
tunaviunganisha pamoja kuwa programu. Nitakupa

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.190
mazoezi kadhaa mfululizo sasa, na pengine

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.700
ni mfululizo mrefu zaidi uliowahi kupata, ambao

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.600
utatumia kila kitu ulichojifunza hapa pamoja na mambo

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:04.120
mengine mengi tuliyojifunza awali. Furahia.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:05.960
Kila la heri, na tutaonana hapa tena

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:06.310
hivi karibuni.
